'''El Pobleno''' ([[Baliscano language|Baliscano]] for "new village") is an extensive, formerly blighted [[Districts of Concepción|district]] of [[Concepción]]. El Pobleno is renowned for being Concepción's historical core of radical political and intellectual activism since the [[Baliscan Revolution]]. It is locally and nationally recognized as the [[Autonomous commune (Balisca)|autonomous anarchist]] quarter of the city, known for its {{W|radical democracy}}.
